python3-pyfasm64 (0.4.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release PyFASM64 0.4.0.
  * Added full Cyrillic/Unicode identifier support via collision-free FASM labels and UTF-8 codepoint len(), indexing, slicing, and Cyrillic .upper()/.lower() (including Ё/ё).
  * Eliminated memory-address printing in Win64 typed/mixed lists, 2D lists, tuples, dicts, sets, loops, f-strings, and str()/int()/float()/.split() conversions.
  * Added runtime class tags (PYFCLSTG), polymorphic virtual method dispatch (_pyfasm_vcall_*), @staticmethod, @classmethod, isinstance()/issubclass(), and full dunder wiring (__call__, __bool__, __neg__/__pos__/__invert__, __iadd__..__ixor__, __enter__/__exit__, __iter__/__next__ + StopIteration).
  * Implemented real lexical closures (ClosureLifter + PYFCLOSU) for capturing lambdas and nested def functions across direct calls, higher-order calls, map(), and filter().

 -- eminsk <M_N_N@tut.by>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:15:00 -0500

